You've been invited to <%= club ? club.name : "Boxd Club" %>.

Boxd Club is a small private movie club that picks what its members watch next
by vote, off their Letterboxd accounts.

<% if club -%>
<%= Mailer.wrap("#{club.mode_invite_note} You rank it, there's no deadline, and the round closes once everyone has voted. Then you all watch the winner and log it on Letterboxd, and the next round opens.") %>
<% else -%>
Each round we put a handful of films on a ballot and you rank them. There's no
deadline — the round closes once everyone has voted. Then you all watch the
winner and log it on Letterboxd, and the next round opens.
<% end -%>

Set yourself up here:
<%= verify_url %>

<% if club.nil? || club.watchlist_mode? -%>
You'll need a public Letterboxd watchlist.
<% else -%>
You'll need a Letterboxd account, so we can tell when you've watched the film.
<% end -%>

--
Boxd Club is an independent fan project. It isn't affiliated with, or endorsed
by, Letterboxd.

Not interested? <%= unsub_url %>
